{"id":"a8c5bcde47c6395b","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter.md","title":"ZFC Top Neighborhood Filter","display":"df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter — ZFC Top Neighborhood Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter","58-df-zfc-filter2-neighborhood-filter","58-df-zfc-filter7-neighborhood-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter — ZFC Top Neighborhood Filter","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top5-neighborhood.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter2-neighborhood-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-neighborhood-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter — ZFC Top Neighborhood Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0ebf4991f4c6dec\" href=\"?note=d0ebf4991f4c6dec\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top5-neighborhood.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top5-neighborhood.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,\\mathcal N,x,X,\\tau\">\\(N,\\mathcal N,x,X,\\tau\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Neighborhood}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Neighborhood}_S\\)</span> (neighborhood predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0ebf4991f4c6dec\" href=\"?note=d0ebf4991f4c6dec\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top5-neighborhood.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top5-neighborhood.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2NeighborhoodFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2NeighborhoodFilter}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7NeighborhoodFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7NeighborhoodFilter}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}neighborhood\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S(N,x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow N\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;(A\\in N\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Neighborhood}_S(X,\\tau,x,A))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}neighborhood\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S(N,x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow N\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;(A\\in N\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Neighborhood}_S(X,\\tau,x,A))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}neighborhood\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2NeighborhoodFilter}_S(\\mathcal N,x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S(\\mathcal N,x,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}neighborhood\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2NeighborhoodFilter}_S(\\mathcal N,x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S(\\mathcal N,x,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}neighborhood\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7NeighborhoodFilter}_S(X,\\tau,x,\\mathcal N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S(\\mathcal N,x,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}neighborhood\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7NeighborhoodFilter}_S(X,\\tau,x,\\mathcal N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S(\\mathcal N,x,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The output is the full neighborhood filter, including non-open neighborhoods; its open members form a neighborhood base.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-filter2-neighborhood-filter</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-filter7-neighborhood-filter</code> are merged here; they used the same neighborhood-filter base formula.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top5-neighborhood.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0ebf4991f4c6dec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top5-neighborhood.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top5-neighborhood.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0ebf4991f4c6dec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\m